{"id":"kyrenia","name":"凯里尼亚","en":"Kyrenia","country":"Cyprus","lat":35.3403,"lng":33.3192,"dek":"石墙与海港之间的静默层理","history":"神话把建城归给特洛伊战争后登陆的阿开亚人，他们用伯罗奔尼撒故乡的名字称呼这片海岸。公元前四世纪的航海记已把它记作港口城镇，与拉皮索斯并列为腓尼基势力影响下的北岸城邦。亚历山大死后，托勒密与安提柯的争锋波及岛上诸王，凯里尼亚一度被并入库普罗斯王国的势力范围，但海贸让它在王国被废后仍继续生长。\n\n罗马人在公元一世纪为城堡打下地基，石砌海堤让船只安全下锚。公元806年，阿拉伯人的袭击毁掉附近的兰布萨，居民迁入城堡脚下，城镇因这道防御而重获分量。1191年，岛上的末代拜占庭总督伊萨克·科穆宁把家眷与财物送进城堡，随后英王理查一世夺岛，将塞浦路斯先卖给圣殿骑士团，又于次年转手给吕西尼昂的居伊。法兰克统治下，凯里尼亚成为本地区的行政与商业中心，卢西尼昂家族扩建城堡、沿镇筑墙，把防御延伸到港口。\n\n1489年塞浦路斯转入威尼斯人之手，他们拆掉城堡的皇家居所和三座单薄的弗兰克式塔楼，代之以能承受炮火的厚实圆塔。1571年，城堡与城镇向奥斯曼军队投降，此后驻军挤占堡内，基督教居民被迁出城墙，小镇一度沦为靠海吃海的商人与渔夫零星聚居的驻防地。","culture":"凯里尼亚的层理刻在石头上：罗马人的地基上面是拜占庭的加固，再往上是卢西尼昂的城墙与塔楼，威尼斯人又在炮火威胁下把塔楼改圆改厚。城堡东侧的旧采石场被早期基督徒用作地下墓室与岩凿墓地，后来其中一些洞穴改成小教堂，墙上还留着圣像。山脊上的圣伊拉里翁、布法文托与坎塔拉三座要塞与海边的城堡互为犄角，共同管住陆路与海面。\n\n今天的城区是土耳其族居民、来自大陆的定居者与英国侨民混居的地方，几所大学带来上万名学生，老港边的咖啡馆和酒吧到夜里依旧亮着灯。每年有一场文化艺术节，几百位艺术家与表演者在城中演出。港湾里停着渔船与游艇，城堡的轮廓压在防波堤尽头，散步的人绕一圈就能看完这层叠的几百年。","pull":"每一层石墙都压着前一个主人的名字","sights":[{"name":"凯里尼亚城堡","orig":"Kyrenia Castle","intro":"守在老港东端的方形堡垒，罗马人打下地基，威尼斯人把塔楼改圆加厚以承炮火。堡内有一座小型沉船博物馆，陈列着1965年在港外海域发现的古船残骸与船上货物，从船体到陶罐都看得清楚。","img":null,"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyrenia_Castle"},{"name":"老港","orig":"Kyrenia Old Harbour","intro":"马蹄形的小港湾，石砌防波堤围出一片平静水面，渔船与游艇并排系在岸边。沿岸是旧仓库改成的咖啡馆与餐馆，傍晚坐在水边能同时看见城堡的墙影和山脊的轮廓。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Kyrenia_Old_Harbour_view_from_Kyrenia_Castle.jpg/960px-Kyrenia_Old_Harbour_view_from_Kyrenia_Castle.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"圣伊拉里翁城堡","orig":"Saint Hilarion Castle","intro":"挂在凯里尼亚山脉南坡上的多层要塞，卢西尼昂家族在拜占庭旧堡基础上扩建。石阶在塔楼、蓄水池与拱厅之间上下穿行，从高处的窗口可以望见北面的海和山下的平原。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Saint_Hilarion_Castle%2C_Northern_Cyprus_-_panoramio_%286%29.jpg/960px-Saint_Hilarion_Castle%2C_Northern_Cyprus_-_panoramio_%286%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint_Hilarion_Castle"},{"name":"布法文托城堡","orig":"Buffavento Castle","intro":"比圣伊拉里翁更高的山脊堡垒，名字意为“抵挡风”，用来瞭望北岸与内陆的动静。到达它要走一段陡峭的山路，顶上只剩石墙与拱门，风从缺口灌进来，视野却铺得很开。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Voufavento_castle.jpg/960px-Voufavento_castle.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buffavento_Castle"},{"name":"贝拉佩斯修道院","orig":"Bellapais Abbey","intro":"凯里尼亚城东山坡上的哥特式修道院废墟，卢西尼昂时期由奥斯定会修士经营。回廊的尖拱与食堂的肋拱还立着，庭院里长着老树，从平台往下看，北岸的海在树梢后面。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Kyrenia_-_Girne_Kloster_Bellapa%C3%ADs_Kirche_7.jpg/960px-Kyrenia_-_Girne_Kloster_Bellapa%C3%ADs_Kirche_7.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bellapais_Abbey"}],"foods":[{"name":"哈罗米奶酪","orig":"Hellim","intro":"塞浦路斯特色的半硬奶酪，常以羊奶或山羊奶混合牛奶制成，质地紧实，煎烤后表面焦黄而内部仍带弹性。在凯里尼亚的早餐桌上常见切片煎过的哈罗米，配面包与橄榄。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/Halloumislice_zoom.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":1064},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halloumi"},{"name":"塞浦路斯咖啡","orig":"Kıbrıs kahvesi","intro":"用细磨咖啡粉在小铜壶里煮成，倒进小杯时连渣一起沉在杯底，喝时慢啜，不滤渣。老港边的咖啡馆里常配一杯清水和一块甜点，坐在遮阳篷下可以消磨很久。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Cypriot_coffee_cup_%288132816258%29.jpg/960px-Cypriot_coffee_cup_%288132816258%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":638},"src":null},{"name":"烤肉串","orig":"Şiş kebab","intro":"腌过的羊肉或鸡肉块穿在铁签上炭火烤熟，配米饭、烤番茄与辣椒上桌。凯里尼亚的餐馆多在傍晚把烤架支到门口，肉香混着海风，是港边常见的晚餐。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Barbecued_lamb_sticks.jpg/960px-Barbecued_lamb_sticks.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%83%A4%E4%B8%B2"},{"name":"果仁蜜饼","orig":"Baklava","intro":"极薄的酥皮层层叠起，中间夹碎核桃或开心果，烤后浇上糖浆，切块出售。在凯里尼亚的甜点铺里常与咖啡同点，入口酥脆，甜味很重，配无糖的塞浦路斯咖啡刚好。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/Baklava%281%29.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%B4%E5%85%8B%E6%8B%89%E7%93%A6"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Kyrenia_01-2017_img02_Castle_exterior.jpg/1280px-Kyrenia_01-2017_img02_Castle_exterior.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":800}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[33.2876262,35.3404149],[33.2943227,35.3398316],[33.2926656,35.3373965],[33.2947313,35.334128],[33.3001227,35.3367946],[33.3008945,35.3359243],[33.2997,35.3292363],[33.3007015,35.3287389],[33.3015528,35.3259516],[33.3008037,35.3203304],[33.2991692,35.3180707],[33.2991125,35.3146995],[33.3004972,35.3146069],[33.3005426,35.3133473],[33.3022905,35.3132732],[33.302631,35.3118932],[33.3045322,35.3110874],[33.3114955,35.3110967],[33.3140663,35.3095268],[33.3187823,35.3110041],[33.3239693,35.3099158],[33.3230556,35.3089108],[33.3269771,35.3106058],[33.326838,35.3121294],[33.3283164,35.3142087],[33.3268068,35.31507],[33.3279872,35.3163481],[33.3286342,35.3197932],[33.3275105,35.3201266],[33.3304048,35.3251552],[33.3308577,35.3340666],[33.3374589,35.3318594],[33.3386053,35.3351835],[33.3387128,35.3382541],[33.3359261,35.3375389],[33.3333896,35.3400754],[33.3358922,35.3424363],[33.3376278,35.3420182],[33.3329031,35.3450467],[33.326382,35.3402059],[33.3254642,35.3411621],[33.3244917,35.3403033],[33.3232461,35.3406644],[33.3231766,35.3426051],[33.3242589,35.3428061],[33.3198278,35.3433869],[33.317072,35.3418288],[33.3158636,35.3428268],[33.3150883,35.3408056],[33.3129296,35.3423785],[33.3106522,35.3416511],[33.3104979,35.3405816],[33.3094988,35.3412751],[33.3085551,35.3406559],[33.3074328,35.3418436],[33.3050656,35.34198],[33.3062232,35.3426445],[33.3026849,35.344171],[33.302348,35.3454911],[33.3017999,35.3435811],[33.3041375,35.3430325],[33.3033519,35.3418447],[33.3008885,35.3428306],[33.3011033,35.344396],[33.2992519,35.3436838],[33.2966775,35.3446583],[33.2951395,35.3442269],[33.2917342,35.3469516],[33.2925435,35.3486416],[33.2932516,35.3477061],[33.2918934,35.3505616],[33.2908666,35.3496368],[33.2915001,35.3472583],[33.2897798,35.3466234],[33.2876262,35.3404149]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"凯里尼亚","en":"Kyrenia","voyage":null}}}